    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Game Quiz 1 : Molecule Naming\nUse the mouse to drag and drop the availiable
    elements to the correct slots to create the molecule's formula.\n\nGame Quzi
    2 : Molecule Construction\nSpawn elements and drag them in the correct slots
    upon the molecule's model, to create its structure.  \n\nGame Quiz 3 : Equation
    Balancing\nAdjust the coefficients of the chemical equation using increase and
    decrease controls until the equation becomes balanced correctly.\n\nGame Quiz
    4 : Flame Test\nUse drag-and-drop interactions to perform the flame test procedure
    by dipping the wire loop into hydrochloric acid, placing it into a salt sample,
    and passing it through the flame to observe color changes and identify chemical
    elements based on their characteristic flame emissions.\n\nGame Quiz 5 : Virtual
    Chemistry Experiment\nInteract with laboratory tools and chemical materials using
    drag-and-drop actions to perform experiments and observe simulated chemical reactions.\n\nGame
    Quiz 6 : Multiple Choice Questions (MCQ)\nAnswer multiple-choice questions by
    selecting the correct option from the available answers."
